      <div class="card feed-composer">
        <div class="chips" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin:0 0 1rem"><span class="chip">Post</span><span class="chip">Question</span><span class="chip">Poll</span></div>
        <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Share something with your class…"></textarea>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem">
          <button class="btn btn-grey btn-sm" type="button">Photo</button>
          <button class="btn btn-grey btn-sm" type="button">Video (YouTube link)</button>
          <button class="btn btn-grey btn-sm" type="button">Poll</button>
          <button class="btn btn-dark btn-sm" type="button" style="margin-left:auto">Post to Feed</button>
        </div>
        <p class="demo-note" style="margin-top:1rem">Frontend design: posting, reactions and comments work on the live site for enrolled students. Posts and comments cannot be edited or deleted by students; only SkillX admins can remove content.</p>
      </div>
